      "name": "Entry 1: methodology & how the three energies are built",
      "text": "The comparison is pinned: 44 of 52 catalogued rides have measured power and a track; the ground truth is raw Σ power·dt (coasting zeros included), matching the sheet's Work Bike column to ~0.3% median; both engines read the same per-ride constants from the rider's own sheet — nothing refit.",
